how much time will Julia have to cook the chicken, if it is considered that the chicken is cooked evenly, with constant speed when the stove is turned on and at a constant speed when it is turned off."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The single line contains three integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"d"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"t"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ k, d, t ≤ 1018"},{"kind":"text","text":")."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print a single number, the total time of cooking in minutes. The relative or absolute error must not exceed "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"10 - 9"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Namely, let's assume that your answer is "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x"},{"kind":"text","text":" and the answer of the jury is "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"y"},{"kind":"text","text":". The checker program will consider your answer correct if "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/82ea9b38623e386f2de316d3ccff64802b669cacd7bf1c4ea68bc96871eca66f.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"3 2 6\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"6.5\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"4 2 20\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"20.0\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first example, the chicken will be cooked for 3 minutes on the turned on stove, after this it will be cooked for "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/fd0148766bc8e9fd9c0b7dc4eab4145f9e583358ed92187e1bf350c99b9dd5af.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":". Then the chicken will be cooked for one minute on a turned off stove, it will be cooked for "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/7a27decf2920c6d931d7c639e7687f110036bee797021e4d90ebf5345f8c003b.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":". Thus, after four minutes the chicken will be cooked for "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/2866b4a515497039f4506a875f571e4c01992b3101845629bff5a0e533607ca9.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":". Before the fifth minute Julia will turn on the stove and after "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"2.5"},{"kind":"text","text":" minutes the chicken will be ready "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/74561fe7b28e94a78a468b63c62adaed0c3eec50d00d78f97262586e652ac969.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second example, when the stove is turned off, Julia will immediately turn it on, so the stove will always be turned on and the chicken will be cooked in 20 minutes."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"A","problemCode":"936A","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/936/problem/A"}